{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-linar","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"linar-alef-group-al-mamzar","about":"Alef Linar Sharjah is a waterfront residential community by Alef Group, set on the east edge of Al Mamzar beach. Spread across 5.5 hectares, the development brings together 5 residential towers and a future commercial tower.The residential collection includes 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments alongside a limited release of 4-bedroom penthouses, with prices starting from AED 849,000. Each residence is built for comfort and connectivity, with floor-to-ceiling proportions, porcelain finishes and spacious balconies that open to uninterrupted views of the Arabian Gulf.Linar by Alef is located on Corniche and Al Taawun Street, with direct links to Al Wuheida Road and Al Ittihad Road. Once completed, residents will enjoy a fully integrated community of retail, dining, co-working spaces, sports courts, lap pools, gyms, and curated wellness areas.","price":849000,"title":"Linar","bitrix":{"id":1511,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"LINAR by Alef Group","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Alef Group","project_location":"Al Mamzar"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Feature_059720d949.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Feature_059720d949.webp"}],"status":null,"_geoloc":{"lat":25.30544000329,"lng":55.361174007708},"country":"sharjah","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gallery_11_210706a7df.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Gallery_11_210706a7df.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gallery_2_462039a316.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Gallery_2_462039a316.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gallery_1_815c